        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/adam/{size}/1946_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-04-24T16:04:43.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Part of our intention is for you to use the game to make your own stories, so we really encourage things like this! The Story Challenges are named as such because they have to do with character backgrounds, creating the situations for great stories to occur, raising tension in come areas, and creating awesome moments in others. If you’re looking for full scenarios, I’d definitely recommend Spiff’s scenario thread, found <a href=\"http://greaterthangames.info/forum/index.php/topic,419.0.html\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">here</a>. He’s done a lot of great work on that.</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:02:57.108Z",
