        "id": 29001,
        "name": "broccoli",
        "username": "broccoli",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/broccoli/{size}/1861_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-04-28T02:56:41.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I’m just curious about one thing.  I see that health, equipment, and ongoings carry over…what do you do about your hand?  Do you discard your hand, shuffle your trash into your deck and start each game fresh with a new hand, or does your hand, deck, and trash stay “as is” as well?</p>\n<p>I ask mainly because this affects different characters different ways.  Tachyon (in particular) loses most of her setup when her trash is shuffled in, and Haka can end the game with a crazy 20-30 card hand, that he would have to discard.</p>",
        "post_number": 3,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:02:57.217Z",
